  "project_description": "Spellcheck for Search API .\n\n Results show: Did you mean [some suggestion]? . like in Google.\n\n Back to top \n\n How to use \n Edit your Views search page and add the Spellcheck field to the Views' Header and/or Footer .\n\n Back to top \n\n Drupal 9 \n It works with any Search API backend that declares itself to support the \"search_api_spellcheck\" feature.\n\nAt the moment automatic tests are only performed by the Search API Solr backend only.\n\n Back to top \n\n Drupal 7 \n The Drupal 7 version of this module is not actively developed anymore. You can use it as it is, but it is recommended to upgrade to Drupal 9 or 10.\n\n Back to top",
